      "text": "To simplify the given expression \\(\\frac{3 + 5i}{3 - 5i} + \\frac{3 - 5i}{3 + 5i}\\), we will first simplify each fraction separately by multiplying the numerator and the denominator by the conjugate of the denominator.\n\nStarting with \\(\\frac{3 + 5i}{3 - 5i}\\):\n\n1. Multiply the numerator and the denominator by the conjugate of the denominator, which is \\(3 + 5i\\):\n\\[\n\\frac{3 + 5i}{3 - 5i} \\cdot \\frac{3 + 5i}{3 + 5i} = \\frac{(3 + 5i)(3 + 5i)}{(3 - 5i)(3 + 5i)}.\n\\]\n\n2. Expand the numerator and the denominator:\n\\[\n(3 + 5i)(3 + 5i) = 3^2 + 2 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 5i + (5i)^2 = 9 + 30i + 25i^2.\n\\]\nSince \\(i^2 = -1\\), we have:\n\\[\n9 + 30i + 25(-1) = 9 + 30i - 25 = -16 + 30i.\n\\]\nThe denominator is:\n\\[\n(3 - 5i)(3 + 5i) = 3^2 - (5i)^2 = 9 - 25i^2 = 9 - 25(-1) = 9 + 25 = 34.\n\\]\nSo, we have:\n\\[\n\\frac{3 + 5i}{3 - 5i} = \\frac{-16 + 30i}{34} = -\\frac{16}{34} + \\frac{30i}{34} = -\\frac{8}{17} + \\frac{15i}{17}.\n\\]\n\nNext, we simplify \\(\\frac{3 - 5i}{3 + 5i}\\):\n\n1. Multiply the numerator and the denominator by the conjugate of the denominator, which is \\(3 - 5i\\):\n\\[\n\\frac{3 - 5i}{3 + 5i} \\cdot \\frac{3 - 5i}{3 - 5i} = \\frac{(3 - 5i)(3 - 5i)}{(3 + 5i)(3 - 5i)}.\n\\]\n\n2. Expand the numerator and the denominator:\n\\[\n(3 - 5i)(3 - 5i) = 3^2 - 2 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 5i + (5i)^2 = 9 - 30i + 25i^2.\n\\]\nSince \\(i^2 = -1\\), we have:\n\\[\n9 - 30i + 25(-1) = 9 - 30i - 25 = -16 - 30i.\n\\]\nThe denominator is:\n\\[\n(3 + 5i)(3 - 5i) = 3^2 - (5i)^2 = 9 - 25i^2 = 9 - 25(-1) = 9 + 25 = 34.\n\\]\nSo, we have:\n\\[\n\\frac{3 - 5i}{3 + 5i} = \\frac{-16 - 30i}{34} = -\\frac{16}{34} - \\frac{30i}{34} = -\\frac{8}{17} - \\frac{15i}{17}.\n\\]\n\nNow, we add the two simplified fractions:\n\\[\n-\\frac{8}{17} + \\frac{15i}{17} + \\left(-\\frac{8}{17} - \\frac{15i}{17}\\right) = \\left(-\\frac{8}{17} - \\frac{8}{17}\\right) + \\left(\\frac{15i}{17} - \\frac{15i}{17}\\right) = -\\frac{16}{17} + 0i = -\\frac{16}{17}.\n\\]\n\nTherefore, the final answer is:\n\\[\n\\boxed{-\\frac{16}{17}}.\n\\]",
